Implement user story epam-ts-002: Fix off-by-one in parseRange — end value excluded

## Story Description
The parseRange function in src/range.ts uses a strict less-than operator (<) in the loop condition, so the end value is never included in the result. Fix it so parseRange(1, 5) returns [1, 2, 3, 4, 5] instead of [1, 2, 3, 4]. The source file(s) are in /tmp/epam-bench-epam-ts-002-4ANBeZ/src/. Do not modify any test files (*.test.ts).

